ilable, with no restoration time given", "observation_mode_label": "structured_live_session", "min_seconds": 480, "max_seconds": 900}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D3-S2-002", "stage_code": "S2", "source_version_hash": "f4b9d654dd45a0f2fbecc08dad80748366a8464e3fef770f4717941245afcdc5", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D3-S2-002' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D3-S2-003', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE DEMONSTRATION THAT STOPPED', 'D3', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.0', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 2, "title": "THE DEMONSTRATION THAT STOPPED", "source_digest": "a89e71e1789ed9112b4a0ff6ad8727b9733aff4fcc29d4f934933547539334a6", "mentor_brief": "The mentor reads the scripted lines of the client organization''s lead. The mentor asks the scripted question once and does not repeat, escalate or add a second challenge. NO OBSERVATION OF THE PARTICIPANT''S MANNER, TONE OR RECOVERY SPEED IS MADE OR RECORDED.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are a sales engineer fifteen minutes into a live product demonstration for the client organization. Five of their people are in the room. You clicked through to the automated reporting feature — the one they asked to see — and the application stopped responding and then closed with an error. There are three remaining items on the demonstration agenda: the reporting feature, the integration walkthrough and the administration console. You have forty minutes left. The demonstration protocol states that any feature shown must be shown working, and that anything not shown is followed up in writing within one business day.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Well. That is not what we were expecting. We have another forty minutes booked. I will let you take it from here.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "PAUSE", "spoken": null, "direction": "Say nothing for ten to fifteen seconds. Do not prompt or fill the silence.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What are we doing with the rest of the session?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Forty minutes left. What are you showing us and what are you not?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C2", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Before you show anything else, what are you checking?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C4", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so I have it right — of the three items on your agenda, which have we seen working and which have we not?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Thank you. We will wait for the follow-up.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D3-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three remaining agenda items; B3 creates the opportunity"}, {"question": "Q-D3-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 asks what is shown and what is not"}, {"question": "Q-D3-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Two stated requirements, one of which the failure already engages"}, {"question": "Q-D3-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 asks what is checked before showing anything else"}, {"question": "Q-D3-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three means, all performable"}, {"question": "Q-D3-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-06a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The failed application is the blocking dependency and B5 engages it"}, {"question": "Q-D3-06b", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The failed application is the blocking dependency and B5 engages it"}, {"question": "Q-D3-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 and B6 both create the opportunity to state what was not shown"}, {"question": "Q-D3-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-08", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "The situation presents no change to the requirement"}, {"question": "Q-D3-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "delivery_test_point at B6"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "WI1", "Item text": "the reporting feature", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "reporting feature — the"}, {"Item": "WI2", "Item text": "the integration walkthrough", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "integration walkthrough and the"}, {"Item": "WI3", "Item text": "the administration console", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "and the administration console"}, {"Item": "SR1", "Item text": "any feature shown is shown working", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "any feature shown must be shown working, and that anything not shown"}, {"Item": "SR2", "Item text": "anything not shown is followed up in writing within one business day", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "shown must be shown working, and that anything not shown is followed up in writing within one business day"}], "source_sheet": {"d3_situation_class": "SC-D3-2", "workplace_demand": "Completing a prepared session when the system it runs on has failed in front of the audience.", "relevant_conduct": "The order stated for the remaining agenda; what was reduced, deferred or dropped; what was stated as held; which checks were named; which means were used; what was done about the failed application; what was stated about the unshown feature; the answer at B6.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The technical cause of the crash; the value of the opportunity; the participant''s composure, tone or choice of words, WHICH ARE NEVER OBSERVED.", "stated_standard": "\"any feature shown must be shown working\" and \"anything not shown is followed up in writing within one business day.\" Exact pre-brief text.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"any feature shown must be shown working\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That continuing was better than stopping; that a recovery attempt was required; anything about presence under workplace pressure.", "compatibility_class": "S2-SEVEN-BEAT", "work_items": [{"id": "WI1", "text": "the reporting feature"}, {"id": "WI2", "text": "the integration walkthrough"}, {"id": "WI3", "text": "the administration console"}], "deliverable_components": [{"id": "DC1", "text": "the reporting demonstration"}, {"id": "DC2", "text": "the integration demonstration"}, {"id": "DC3", "text": "the administration demonstration"}], "stated_requirements": [{"id": "SR1", "text": "any feature shown is shown working"}, {"id": "SR2", "text": "anything not shown is followed up in writing within one business day"}], "available_checks": [{"id": "CK1", "text": "restart and confirm the application runs before showing anything further"}, {"id": "CK2", "text": "confirm which of the remaining two items run on the failed component"}], "available_means": [{"id": "MN1", "text": "show the remaining two items and defer the reporting feature"}, {"id": "MN2", "text": "use a recorded walkthrough of the reporting feature"}, {"id": "MN3", "text": "close the session early and commit the written follow-up"}], "time_available": "Forty minutes.", "work_required": "Three agenda items, one of which cannot be shown working.", "blocking_dependency": "The application has closed with an error and its state is unknown.", "dependency_holder_role": null, "moved_standard_point": null, "handover_point": "The end of the session, inside the observation at B4 and B6.", "delivery_state_record": "At B6: the reporting feature was not shown working; the integration and administration items have not been reached.", "delivery_test_point": "B6", "list_note": null, "source_note": "dependency_holder_role: The failure is in the participant''s own demonstration environment.", "situation_class_label": "A tool or resource the work depends on is unavailable, with no restoration time given", "observation_mode_label": "structured_live_session", "min_seconds": 480, "max_seconds": 900}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D3-S2-003", "stage_code": "S2", "source_version_hash": "a89e71e1789ed9112b4a0ff6ad8727b9733aff4fcc29d4f934933547539334a6", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D3-S2-003' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D3-S2-004', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'TWO WEEKS ON THE WRONG REPORT', 'D3', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.0', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 2, "title": "TWO WEEKS ON THE WRONG REPORT", "source_digest": "b6e241d9950e810ade06fc3d88597d020def36dbf38d997c25f3c50317f400af", "mentor_brief": "The mentor reads the scripted lines of the client organization''s marketing director. The mentor states the mismatch once and does not repeat, press or characterise it.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are a project coordinator. You have just presented a twenty-page competitive landscape analysis to the client organization, produced over two weeks. The signed proposal names customer journey mapping as the Phase 1 deliverable. The client has a board presentation in ten calendar days that uses the Phase 1 data. Customer journey mapping Phase 1 normally requires fifteen working days from the discovery data you already hold, and no additional analyst is available. The engagement terms state that Phase 1 is delivered before the board date and that any deliverable is reviewed against the proposal scope before presentation.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "This is a competitive landscape analysis. The proposal names customer journey mapping as the Phase 1 deliverable. I will let you respond.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "PAUSE", "spoken": null, "direction": "Say nothing for ten to fifteen seconds. Do not prompt or fill the silence.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Where does Phase 1 stand?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Ten days to the board. What can be built and what cannot?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C2", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What gets checked this time, and against what?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C4", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so I have it right — what do we have now, and what do we not?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Thank you. I will wait to hear.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D3-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Four work items in ten days"}, {"question": "Q-D3-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 asks what can be built"}, {"question": "Q-D3-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Two stated requirements"}, {"question": "Q-D3-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 as