iting within five business days", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "figure carries its source reference and that a disputed figure is reconciled in writing within five business days"}], "source_sheet": {"d3_situation_class": "SC-D3-5", "workplace_demand": "Continuing a presentation when a figure the rest of it depends on cannot be verified in the room.", "relevant_conduct": "The order stated for the remaining slides; what was deferred or dropped; what was stated as held; which checks were named and against which source; which means were used; what was done about the unreachable data team; what was stated about the unverified figures; the answer at B6.", "irrelevant_conduct": "Which figure is correct; how the discrepancy arose, WHICH IS A D2 MATTER; the finance lead''s tone.", "stated_standard": "\"every figure carries its source reference\" and \"a disputed figure is reconciled in writing within five business days.\" Exact pre-brief text.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"every figure carries its source reference\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That defending the figure would be wrong; that stopping the presentation was required; anything about credibility.", "compatibility_class": "S2-SEVEN-BEAT", "work_items": [{"id": "WI1", "text": "the four retention-dependent slides"}, {"id": "WI2", "text": "the remainder of the pack"}, {"id": "WI3", "text": "the written reconciliation"}], "deliverable_components": [{"id": "DC1", "text": "the retention figure on slide eight"}, {"id": "DC2", "text": "the four dependent slides"}, {"id": "DC3", "text": "the independent remainder of the pack"}, {"id": "DC4", "text": "the written reconciliation"}], "stated_requirements": [{"id": "SR1", "text": "every figure carries its source reference"}, {"id": "SR2", "text": "a disputed figure is reconciled in writing within five business days"}], "available_checks": [{"id": "CK1", "text": "state the source reference for the retention figure"}, {"id": "CK2", "text": "identify in the room which other figures draw on the same source"}], "available_means": [{"id": "MN1", "text": "mark the retention figure and its dependants as unverified and continue"}, {"id": "MN2", "text": "present only the slides that do not depend on the figure"}, {"id": "MN3", "text": "commit a reconciliation date in the room"}], "time_available": "The remainder of the review.", "work_required": "A pack of which five slides rest on a figure that cannot be verified now.", "blocking_dependency": "The participant''s own data team is unreachable during the session.", "dependency_holder_role": "The data team. RETAINED AND NEVER RENDERED.", "moved_standard_point": null, "handover_point": "The end of the review, inside the observation.", "delivery_state_record": "At B6: the retention figure is disputed and unverified; four further slides depend on it; no reconciliation exists.", "delivery_test_point": "B6", "list_note": null, "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "Work that cannot proceed until something outside the participant''s control moves", "observation_mode_label": "structured_live_session", "min_seconds": 480, "max_seconds": 900}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D3-S2-005", "stage_code": "S2", "source_version_hash": "90992a6348e6f415a06f5c31d9b9ea9e23543bb86a9fabaabcc8cf05cfbab3c5", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D3-S2-005' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
