the five functional faults are unfixed."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "You hold sales; state that thirty deals are pending on the launch date."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D3-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Four work items against a fixed date"}, {"question": "Q-D3-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 asks what ships"}, {"question": "Q-D3-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Two stated requirements, both engaged"}, {"question": "Q-D3-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 asks what is verified"}, {"question": "Q-D3-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three means"}, {"question": "Q-D3-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-06a", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "blocking_dependency is an explicit none"}, {"question": "Q-D3-06b", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "blocking_dependency is an explicit none"}, {"question": "Q-D3-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "THE KNOWN-ISSUE NOTICE IS A HANDOVER WITH ITS GAPS ON ITS FACE — the clearest CE-D3-07 instance in the bank"}, {"question": "Q-D3-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-08", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "The situation presents no change to the requirement"}, {"question": "Q-D3-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Test point at B6"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "WI1", "Item text": "fix the five functional faults", "Where the participant meets it": "Beat B4", "Quoted text": "Five functional faults and"}, {"Item": "WI2", "Item text": "fix the nine cosmetic faults", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "faults: nine cosmetic, five"}, {"Item": "WI3", "Item text": "write the known-issue notice", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "notice, and that the release notes list every known"}, {"Item": "WI4", "Item text": "update the release notes", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "that no functional fault affecting data accuracy ships without either a fix or a published known-issue notice, and that the release notes"}, {"Item": "SR1", "Item text": "no data-accuracy fault ships without a fix or a published known-issue notice", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "fault affecting data accuracy ships without either a fix or a published known-issue notice, and that the release notes list every known"}, {"Item": "SR2", "Item text": "the release notes list every known fault", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "fault affecting data accuracy ships without either a fix or a published known-issue notice, and that the release notes list every known"}], "source_sheet": {"d3_situation_class": "SC-D3-4", "workplace_demand": "Deciding what ships on a fixed launch date when the fixes cannot all be completed.", "relevant_conduct": "The order stated; what was reduced, deferred or dropped; what was stated as held; which checks were named or performed; which means were named or used; what was identified as incomplete at handover; the answer when the delivery state was put to the participant.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The pending deals; the co-participants'' positions.", "stated_standard": "SR-01 and SR-02.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"fault affecting data accuracy ships without either a fix or a published known-issue notice, and that the release notes list every known\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations affecting turn order or response window are recorded and set timing_not_comparable.", "unsupported_inferences": "That shipping with known faults is gambling; that delaying loses position; anything about commercial courage.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "work_items": [{"id": "WI1", "text": "fix the five functional faults"}, {"id": "WI2", "text": "fix the nine cosmetic faults"}, {"id": "WI3", "text": "write the known-issue notice"}, {"id": "WI4", "text": "update the release notes"}], "deliverable_components": [{"id": "DC1", "text": "the functional fixes"}, {"id": "DC2", "text": "the cosmetic fixes"}, {"id": "DC3", "text": "the known-issue notice"}, {"id": "DC4", "text": "the release notes"}], "stated_requirements": [{"id": "SR1", "text": "no data-accuracy fault ships without a fix or a published known-issue notice"}, {"id": "SR2", "text": "the release notes list every known fault"}], "available_checks": [{"id": "CK1", "text": "re-test the five under high concurrent load"}, {"id": "CK2", "text": "confirm the release notes against the full fault list"}], "available_means": [{"id": "MN1", "text": "ship on Monday with a published known-issue notice"}, {"id": "MN2", "text": "hold to the following Wednesday and ship fixed"}, {"id": "MN3", "text": "ship the cosmetic fixes and hold the functional ones"}], "time_available": "To Monday, or nine days to the alternative.", "work_required": "Six development days on the functional faults alone.", "blocking_dependency": null, "dependency_holder_role": null, "moved_standard_point": null, "handover_point": "The release itself, stated at B4.", "delivery_state_record": "At B6: nine cosmetic and five functional faults open; none fixed.", "delivery_test_point": "B6", "list_note": null, "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "A deliverable that can be completed only in part by the time it is due", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D3-S4-004", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "50294e46ef187b92bef05d24ab55f2ead7f3e25f693ae0e65247b0ea758da70a", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D3-S4-004' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D3-S4-005', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE CHAIN WITH ONE FIXED LINK', 'D3', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.0', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "THE CHAIN WITH ONE FIXED LINK", "source_digest": "2e7b573bce3298a102ef77c194d55894cdfcbf44fe766df90bef0534ab499829", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are on a product launch team twenty-one days from launch. The launch runs as a chain: packaging design finalization, then print production, then fill and pack at the manufacturing site, then distribution to retailers. The manufacturing window is booked and cannot be moved; missing it means a six-week wait. Packaging design is three days late. The launch agreement states that retailers receive stock five days before the launch date, and that no artwork goes to print without brand sign-off.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Thank you all. I will hear each of you in turn, in the order on your cards, and then I will turn to the last of you. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Where does the chain stand?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Three days late into a fixed window. What moves and what does not?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C2", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What gets checked before artwork goes to print?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C4", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the position is right — as of now, which links are complete and which are not?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "That is the session. Thank you all.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "You hold packaging design; state that sign-off is three days late."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "You hold manufacturing; state that the window cannot move."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "You hold retail distribution; state that retailers need stock five days ahead."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D3-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "A four-link chain with one link late"}, {"question": "Q-D3-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 asks what moves"}, {"question": "Q-D3-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Two stated requirements"}, {"question": "Q-D3-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 asks what is checked before print"}, {"question": "Q-D3-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three means"}, {"question": "Q-D3-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-06a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "THE FIXED MANUFACTURING WINDOW IS THE BINDING CONSTRAINT and the clearest CE-D3-06 instance in the bank"}, {"question": "Q-D3-06b", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "THE FIXED MANUFACTURING WINDOW IS THE BINDING CONSTRAINT and the clearest CE-D3-06 instance in the bank"}, {"question": "Q-D3-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 and B6 create the opportunity"}, {"question": "Q-D3-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-08", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "The situation presents no change to the requirement"}, {"question": "Q-D3-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Test point at B6"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "WI1", "Item text": "packaging design sign-off", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "packaging design finalization, then"}, {"Item": "WI2", "Item text": "print production", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "print production, then fill"}, {"Item": "WI3", "Item text": "fill and pack", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "fill and pack at"}, {"Item": "WI4", "Item text": "distribution", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "then distribution to retailers"}, {"Item": "SR1", "Item text": "retailers receive stock five days before launch", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "launch agreement states that retailers receive stock five days before the launch"}, {"Item": "SR2", "Item text": "no artwork goes to print without brand sign-off", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "artwork goes to print without brand"}], "source_sheet": {"d3_situation_class": "SC-D3-5", "workplace_demand": "Moving a launch chain through one link that cannot move.", "relevant_conduct": "The order stated; what was reduced, deferred or dropped; what was stated as held; which checks were named or performed; which means were named or used; what was done about the item outside the participant''s control; what happened to the work while it remained; what was identified as incomplete at handover; the answer when the delivery state was put to the participant.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The co-participants'' positions; the cause of the design delay, WHICH IS A D2 MATTER.", "stated_standard": "SR-01 and SR-02.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"launch agreement states that retailers receive stock five days before the launch\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations affecting turn order or response window are recorded and set timing_not_comparable.", "unsupported_inferences": "That the chain should have been buffered; that any link should give first; anything about planning ability.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "work_items": [{"id": "WI1", "text": "packaging design sign-off"}, {"id": "WI2", "text": "print production"}, {"id": "WI3", "text": "fill and pack"}, {"id": "WI4", "text": "distribution"}], "deliverable_components": [{"id": "DC1", "text": "packaging design sign-off"}, {"id": "DC2", "text": "print production"}, {"id": "DC3", "text": "fill and pack"}, {"id": "DC4", "text": "distribution"}], "stated_requirements": [{"id": "SR1", "text": "retailers receive stock five days before launch"}, {"id": "SR2", "text": "no artwork goes to print without brand sign-off"}], "available_checks": [{"id": "CK1", "text": "brand sign-off on the artwork"}, {"id": "CK2", "text": "confirm print turnaround against the manufacturing window"}], "available_means": [{"id": "MN1", "text": "shorten print production by splitting the run"}, {"id": "MN2", "text": "ship to retailers direct from manufacturing"}, {"id": "MN3", "text": "seek a partial manufacturing slot"}], "time_available": "Twenty-one days.", "work_required": "A four-link chain with the first link three days late.", "blocking_dependency": "The manufacturing window is booked and cannot move.", "dependency_holder_role": "The manufacturing site.", "moved_standard_point": null, "handover_point": "Retailer delivery.", "delivery_state_record": "At B6: design not signed off, print not started, window fixed.", "delivery_test_point": "B6", "list_note": null, "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "Work that cannot proceed until something outside the participant''s control moves", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D3-S4-005", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "2e7b573bce3298a102ef77c194d55894cdfcbf44fe766df90bef0534ab499829", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D3-S4-005' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D3-S4-006', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE ELEVENTH CHANGE REQUEST', 'D3', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.0', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "THE ELEVENTH CHANGE REQUEST", "source_digest": "df83049a0bfa8ad1a12029e8701d6c4b26028f8d80aa243ebc67b793332bf73a", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are on a professional services delivery team. Over eighteen weeks the client has made ten accommodated change requests, none priced. The eleventh arrives during this meeting. The remaining plan has three pieces — the final build, user acceptance testing and the closing report — of about two weeks each, with five weeks left. The contract states that scope changes are priced before work begins, and that the closing report is delivered within the contracted fee.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Thank you all. I will hear each of you in turn, in the order on your cards, and then I will turn to the last of you. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Where does the plan stand with the eleventh in it?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Five weeks and three pieces. What is delivered and what is not?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C2", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What gets checked before anything more is accepted?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C4", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the position is right — as of now, which pieces are complete and which are not?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "That is the session. Thank you all.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "You hold commercials; state that the engagement is at ninety-four per cent of fee with five weeks left."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "You hold delivery; state that the ten accommodations added about three weeks of work."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "You are the client-facing lead; state that the client has just asked for an eleventh change."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D3-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Four work items in five weeks"}, {"question": "Q-D3-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 asks what is delivered"}, {"question": "Q-D3-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Two stated requirements, both under workplace pressure"}, {"question": "Q-D3-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 asks what is checked before accepting more"}, {"question": "Q-D3-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three means"}, {"question": "Q-D3-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-06a", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "blocking_dependency is an explicit none"}, {"question": "Q-D3-06b", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "blocking_dependency is an explicit none"}, {"question": "Q-D3-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 and B6 create the opportunity"}, {"question": "Q-D3-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-08", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "THE ELEVENTH CHANGE ARRIVES IN THE ROUND. All four conduct answers reachable"}, {"question": "Q-D3-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Test point at B6"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "WI1", "Item text": "final build", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "final build, user acceptance"}, {"Item": "WI2", "Item text": "user acceptance testing", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "user acceptance testing and"}, {"Item": "WI3", "Item text": "closing report", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "closing report — of"}, {"Item": "WI4", "Item text": "price the accumulated changes", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "changes are priced before"}, {"Item": "SR1", "Item text": "scope changes are priced before work begins", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "scope changes are priced before work begins"}, {"Item": "SR2", "Item text": "the closing report is delivered within the contracted fee", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "contract states that scope changes are priced before work begins, and that the closing report is delivered within the contracted fee"}], "source_sheet": {"d3_situation_class": "SC-D3-3", "workplace_demand": "Deciding what happens to the remaining plan when another change request arrives in the meeting.", "relevant_conduct": "The order stated; what was reduced, deferred or dropped; what was stated as held; which checks were named or performed; which means were named or used; what was identified as incomplete at handover; what was done with the work already performed when the requirement changed; the answer when the delivery state was put to the participant.", "irrelevant_conduct": "Who accepted the earlier ten, WHICH IS A D2 MATTER; the co-participants'' positions.", "stated_standard": "SR-01 and SR-02.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"scope changes are priced before work begins\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations affecting turn order or response window are recorded and set timing_not_comparable.", "unsupported_inferences": "That accommodating was weakness; that the pattern should have been stopped earlier; anything about assertiveness.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "work_items": [{"id": "WI1", "text": "final build"}, {"id": "WI2", "text": "user acceptance testing"}, {"id": "WI3", "text": "closing report"}, {"id": "WI4", "text": "price the accumulated changes"}], "deliverable_components": [{"id": "DC1", "text": "final build"}, {"id": "DC2", "text": "user acceptance testing"}, {"id": "DC3", "text": "closing report"}, {"id": "DC4", "text": "the change pricing"}], "stated_requirements": [{"id": "SR1", "text": "scope changes are priced before work begins"}, {"id": "SR2", "text": "the closing report is delivered within the contracted fee"}], "available_checks": [{"id": "CK1", "text": "compare the eleven changes against the contracted scope item by item"}, {"id": "CK2", "text": "confirm the remaining fee covers the remaining plan"}], "available_means": [{"id": "MN1", "text": "price the eleventh before accepting it"}, {"id": "MN2", "text": "price the accumulated ten retrospectively"}, {"id": "MN3", "text": "deliver the three pieces and defer the eleventh to a further engagement"}], "time_available": "Five weeks.", "work_required": "Three pieces of about two weeks each, plus an unpriced change.", "blocking_dependency": null, "dependency_holder_role": null, "moved_standard_point": "B2, when the eleventh change is stated in the round.", "handover_point": "The closing report.", "delivery_state_record": "At B6: three pieces outstanding, five weeks, eleven changes of which none is priced.", "delivery_test_point": "B6", "list_note": null, "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "The deadline or scope moves after work has begun", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D3-S4-006", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "df83049a0bfa8ad1a12029e8701d6c4b26028f8d80aa243ebc67b793332bf73a", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D3-S4-006' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D3-S4-007', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE REPORTING PLATFORM IS DOWN', 'D3', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.0', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "THE REPORTING PLATFORM IS DOWN", "source_digest": "beb81f1c332ba965f7f0842210e0c17125c0d9ed8b9c06733e864fce2c6b0f9c", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are on an analytics team. The reporting platform that produces the monthly client packs has been unavailable since yesterday with no restoration time. Eight client packs are due in three days. Each pack has four sections; two of the four come from the platform. Manual production takes about three hours a pack against twenty minutes automated. The service agreement states that every pack carries its source reference and that packs are delivered on the contracted day.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Thank you all. I will hear each of you in turn, in the order on your cards, and then I will turn to the last of you. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Where does the delivery stand?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Eight packs, three days, no platform. What goes out and what does not?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C2", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What gets checked on a manually produced pack before it leaves?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C4", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the position is right — as of now, which packs are ready and which are not?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "That is the session. Thank you all.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "You hold the platform relationship; state there is no restoration time."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "You hold client delivery; state the eight packs are contracted for the same day."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "You hold the team; state that manual production is about three hours a pack."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D3-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Four work items across eight packs"}, {"question": "Q-D3-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 asks what goes out"}, {"question": "Q-D3-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Two stated requirements in tension"}, {"question": "Q-D3-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 asks what is checked on a manual pack"}, {"question": "Q-D3-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three means"}, {"question": "Q-D3-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-06a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The unavailable platform is the blocking dependency"}, {"question": "Q-D3-06b", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The unavailable platform is the blocking dependency"}, {"question": "Q-D3-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 and B6 create the opportunity"}, {"question": "Q-D3-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-08", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "The situation presents no change to the requirement"}, {"question": "Q-D3-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Test point at B6"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "WI1", "Item text": "the two platform-dependent sections across eight packs", "Where the participant meets it": "Beat B4", "Quoted text": "Eight packs, three days, no platform"}, {"Item": "WI2", "Item text": "the two independent sections", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "sections; two of the"}, {"Item": "WI3", "Item text": "assembly", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "Each pack has four sections"}, {"Item": "WI4", "Item text": "delivery", "Where the participant meets it": "Beat B3", "Quoted text": "does the delivery stand?"}, {"Item": "SR1", "Item text": "every pack carries its source reference", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "every pack carries its source reference and that packs"}, {"Item": "SR2", "Item text": "packs are delivered on the contracted day", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "pack carries its source reference and that packs are delivered on the contracted day"}], "source_sheet": {"d3_situation_class": "SC-D3-2", "workplace_demand": "Producing client packs on time while the platform that produces half of each pack is down.", "relevant_conduct": "The order stated; what was reduced, deferred or dropped; what was stated as held; which checks were named or performed; which means were named or used; what was done about the item outside the participant''s control; what happened to the work while it remained; what was identified as incomplete at handover; the answer when the delivery state was put to the participant.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The platform failure''s cause; the co-participants'' positions.", "stated_standard": "SR-01 and SR-02.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"every pack carries its source reference and that packs\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations affecting turn order or response window are recorded and set timing_not_comparable.", "unsupported_inferences": "That manual production is a failure; that the packs should be delayed; anything about resourcefulness.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "work_items": [{"id": "WI1", "text": "the two platform-dependent sections across eight packs"}, {"id": "WI2", "text": "the two independent sections"}, {"id": "WI3", "text": "assembly"}, {"id": "WI4", "text": "delivery"}], "deliverable_components": [{"id": "DC1", "text": "the volumes section"}, {"id": "DC2", "text": "the service section"}, {"id": "DC3", "text": "the commentary"}, {"id": "DC4", "text": "the appendix"}], "stated_requirements": [{"id": "SR1", "text": "every pack carries its source reference"}, {"id": "SR2", "text": "packs are delivered on the contracted day"}], "available_checks": [{"id": "CK1", "text": "source-reference check on manually produced figures"}, {"id": "CK2", "text": "a second-reader check on one pack before the rest follow"}], "available_means": [{"id": "MN1", "text": "produce the platform sections manually"}, {"id": "MN2", "text": "issue the two independent sections on the day and the rest on restoration"}, {"id": "MN3", "text": "prioritize packs by contracted time of day"}], "time_available": "Three days.", "work_required": "Eight packs at about three hours each manually.", "blocking_dependency": "The reporting platform is unavailable with no restoration time.", "dependency_holder_role": "The platform provider.", "moved_standard_point": null, "handover_point": "Pack delivery, stated at B4.", "delivery_state_record": "At B6: no pack produced; platform unavailable.", "delivery_test_point": "B6", "list_note": null, "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "A tool or resource the work depends on is unavailable, with no restoration time given", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D3-S4-007", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "beb81f1c332ba965f7f0842210e0c17125c0d9ed8b9c06733e864fce2c6b0f9c", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D3-S4-007' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D3-S4-008', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'SAFETY, REVENUE AND ONE SENIOR TECHNICIAN', 'D3', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.0', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "SAFETY, REVENUE AND ONE SENIOR TECHNICIAN", "source_digest": "4b8c90ffbb5b28fd74ef18e28dcd92bda4d371c771d144a3e057076426bb1dce", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are on a facilities operations team. Four work orders are open this morning and one senior technician is available. A fire-suppression fault at a warehouse is a safety item. A cooling fault in a data room risks equipment. A lift outage in an office building affects access. A lighting fault in a retail unit is cosmetic. The maintenance standard states that a safety item is attended within two hours of being raised, and that any work order not attended the same day is logged with a reason.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Thank you all. I will hear each of you in turn, in the order on your cards, and then I will turn to the last of you. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What order are the four going in?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "One technician and four orders. What gets attended today and what does not?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C2", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What gets confirmed before an order is closed?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C4", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the position is right — as of now, which orders are attended and which are not?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "That is the session. Thank you all.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "You hold the warehouse; state the fire-suppression fault and its time of raising."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "You hold the data room; state the equipment risk."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "You hold client relations; state that the retail tenant is threatening to end their contract."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D3-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Four orders, one technician; B3 asks the order"}, {"question": "Q-D3-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "FOUR ITEMS — the ordering set is fully exercised"}, {"question": "Q-D3-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 asks what gets attended"}, {"question": "Q-D3-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Two stated requirements, one time-bound"}, {"question": "Q-D3-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 asks what is confirmed before closure"}, {"question": "Q-D3-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three means"}, {"question": "Q-D3-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-06a", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "blocking_dependency is an explicit none"}, {"question": "Q-D3-06b", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "blocking_dependency is an explicit none"}, {"question": "Q-D3-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The logged reason is the handover with its gaps identified"}, {"question": "Q-D3-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-08", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "The situation presents no change to the requirement"}, {"question": "Q-D3-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Test point at B6"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "WI1", "Item text": "fire suppression", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "A fire-suppression fault at a warehouse is a safety item"}, {"Item": "WI2", "Item text": "data room cooling", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "cooling fault in a data room"}, {"Item": "WI3", "Item text": "lift outage", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "lift outage in an"}, {"Item": "WI4", "Item text": "retail lighting", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "lighting fault in a retail"}, {"Item": "SR1", "Item text": "a safety item is attended within two hours of being raised", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "safety item is attended within two hours of being raised, and that any work order not attended"}, {"Item": "SR2", "Item text": "any order not attended the same day is logged with a reason", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "attended within two hours of being raised, and that any work order not attended the same day is logged with a reason"}], "source_sheet": {"d3_situation_class": "SC-D3-1", "workplace_demand": "Ordering four work orders against one available technician.", "relevant_conduct": "The order stated; what was reduced, deferred or dropped; what was stated as held; which checks were named or performed; which means were named or used; what was identified as incomplete at handover; the answer when the delivery state was put to the participant.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The tenant''s threat; the co-participants'' positions.", "stated_standard": "SR-01 and SR-02.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"safety item is attended within two hours of being raised, and that any work order not attended\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations affecting turn order or response window are recorded and set timing_not_comparable.", "unsupported_inferences": "That the revenue threat should or should not have moved the order; THAT A CHANGE IN THE STATED ORDER DURING THE SESSION REVEALS ANYTHING ABOUT PRINCIPLE.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "work_items": [{"id": "WI1", "text": "fire suppression"}, {"id": "WI2", "text": "data room cooling"}, {"id": "WI3", "text": "lift outage"}, {"id": "WI4", "text": "retail lighting"}], "deliverable_components": [{"id": "DC1", "text": "fire suppression"}, {"id": "DC2", "text": "data room cooling"}, {"id": "DC3", "text": "lift outage"}, {"id": "DC4", "text": "retail lighting"}], "stated_requirements": [{"id": "SR1", "text": "a safety item is attended within two hours of being raised"}, {"id": "SR2", "text": "any order not attended the same day is logged with a reason"}], "available_checks": [{"id": "CK1", "text": "confirm the safety item is closed against the standard before moving on"}, {"id": "CK2", "text": "confirm each unattended order carries a logged reason"}], "available_means": [{"id": "MN1", "text": "call in a second technician at cost"}, {"id": "MN2", "text": "attend the safety item and log the rest"}, {"id": "MN3", "text": "ask the tenant to accept a next-day attendance"}], "time_available": "One working day.", "work_required": "Four orders, one technician.", "blocking_dependency": null, "dependency_holder_role": null, "moved_standard_point": null, "handover_point": "Each order closure, inside the observation.", "delivery_state_record": "At B6: four orders open, one technician, none attended.", "delivery_test_point": "B6", "list_note": null, "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "More work than the available time allows, with the gap stated in the situation", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D3-S4-008", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "4b8c90ffbb5b28fd74ef18e28dcd92bda4d371c771d144a3e057076426bb1dce", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D3-S4-008' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D3-S4-009', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE ENGAGEMENT TAKEN OVER MID-FLIGHT', 'D3', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.0', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "THE ENGAGEMENT TAKEN OVER MID-FLIGHT", "source_digest": "f36803ea54f55083bcedf12b66bbf27dd866a52d165fee177b92f1dfe78ef394", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are on a consulting team that has taken over an engagement from a departing colleague. The client review is in four days. The handover consisted of a file share and a fifteen-minute call. Four workstreams are in flight — discovery, analysis, recommendations and the implementation plan — and the status of each is recorded only in a tracker last updated three weeks ago. The engagement terms state that the client review presents the current position of every workstream, and that anything not verified is presented as not verified.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Thank you all. I will hear each of you in turn, in the order on your cards, and then I will turn to the last of you. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Where do the four workstreams stand?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Four days. What position can the review give and what can it not?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C2", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What gets verified before the review, and against what?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C4", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the position is right — as of now, which workstreams are confirmed and which are not?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "That is the session. Thank you all.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6a", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "You hold discovery; state that your workstream is complete."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "You hold analysis; state that you cannot confirm the tracker is current."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "You hold the client relationship; state that the client expects a full position in four days."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D3-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Four workstreams in four days"}, {"question": "Q-D3-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 asks what position the review can give"}, {"question": "Q-D3-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Two stated requirements, the second engaged directly"}, {"question": "Q-D3-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 asks what is verified and against what"}, {"question": "Q-D3-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three means"}, {"question": "Q-D3-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-06a", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The stale tracker and thin handover are the blocking dependency"}, {"question": "Q-D3-06b", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The stale tracker and thin handover are the blocking dependency"}, {"question": "Q-D3-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "THE REVIEW IS A HANDOVER WITH GAPS and SR-02 makes identifying them the requirement"}, {"question": "Q-D3-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-08", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "The situation presents no change to the requirement"}, {"question": "Q-D3-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Test point at B6"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "WI1", "Item text": "reconstruct discovery", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "discovery, analysis, recommendations and"}, {"Item": "WI2", "Item text": "reconstruct analysis", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "analysis, recommendations and the"}, {"Item": "WI3", "Item text": "reconstruct recommendations", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "recommendations and the implementation"}, {"Item": "WI4", "Item text": "reconstruct the implementation plan", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "implementation plan — and"}, {"Item": "SR1", "Item text": "the review presents the current position of every workstream", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "review presents the current position of every workstream, and that anything not verified is presented"}, {"Item": "SR2", "Item text": "anything not verified is presented as not verified", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "presents the current position of every workstream, and that anything not verified is presented as not verified"}], "source_sheet": {"d3_situation_class": "SC-D3-7", "workplace_demand": "Taking over in-flight work whose status is recorded only in an old tracker.", "relevant_conduct": "The order stated; what was reduced, deferred or dropped; what was stated as held; which checks were named or performed; which means were named or used; what was done about the item outside the participant''s control; what happened to the work while it remained; what was identified as incomplete at handover; the answer when the delivery state was put to the participant.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The departing colleague''s handover; the co-participants'' positions.", "stated_standard": "SR-01 and SR-02.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"review presents the current position of every workstream, and that anything not verified is presented\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations affecting turn order or response window are recorded and set timing_not_comparable.", "unsupported_inferences": "That the handover was inadequate; that presenting unverified positions is concealment; ANY COMPARISON BETWEEN WHAT P-OBS SAID INTERNALLY AND WHAT THEY WOULD SAY TO THE CLIENT.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "work_items": [{"id": "WI1", "text": "reconstruct discovery"}, {"id": "WI2", "text": "reconstruct analysis"}, {"id": "WI3", "text": "reconstruct recommendations"}, {"id": "WI4", "text": "reconstruct the implementation plan"}], "deliverable_components": [{"id": "DC1", "text": "reconstruct discovery"}, {"id": "DC2", "text": "reconstruct analysis"}, {"id": "DC3", "text": "reconstruct recommendations"}, {"id": "DC4", "text": "reconstruct the implementation plan"}], "stated_requirements": [{"id": "SR1", "text": "the review presents the current position of every workstream"}, {"id": "SR2", "text": "anything not verified is presented as not verified"}], "available_checks": [{"id": "CK1", "text": "reconcile the tracker against the file share per workstream"}, {"id": "CK2", "text": "confirm one workstream with the client directly"}], "available_means": [{"id": "MN1", "text": "verify two workstreams and present the rest as unverified"}, {"id": "MN2", "text": "move the review by a week"}, {"id": "MN3", "text": "reach the departing colleague for one further call"}], "time_available": "Four days.", "work_required": "Four workstreams whose status is three weeks stale.", "blocking_dependency": "The tracker is three weeks old and the departing colleague gave a fifteen-minute handover.", "dependency_holder_role": "A departing colleague.", "moved_standard_point": null, "handover_point": "The client review.", "delivery_state_record": "At B6: four workstreams, tracker three weeks stale, none verified.", "delivery_test_point": "B6", "list_note": null, "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "Work received from, or passed to, another party in an incomplete state", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D3-S4-009", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "f36803ea54f55083bcedf12b66bbf27dd866a52d165fee177b92f1dfe78ef394", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D3-S4-009' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D3-S4-010', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE FOURTH REVISION OF THE SAME BRIEF', 'D3', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.0', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "THE FOURTH REVISION OF THE SAME BRIEF", "source_digest": "6146fce4287c7a9360a838817bcebe08ca73b19bf2086656629ebb1928f9a145", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are on a delivery team whose client has revised the brief three times in nine weeks, each revision arriving after work on the previous one had begun. The fourth revision arrives in this meeting. The remaining plan has three pieces — the build, the review cycle and the handover pack — of about three weeks each, with seven weeks left. The contract states that a revision is accepted in writing before work begins on it, and that the handover pack is delivered at the contracted end date.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Thank you all. I will hear each of you in turn, in the order on your cards, and then I will turn to the last of you. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Where does the plan stand with the fourth in it?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Seven weeks and a fourth revision. What is delivered and what is not?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C2", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What gets checked before the fourth revision is accepted?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C4", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the position is right — as of now, which pieces are complete and which are not?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "That is the session. Thank you all.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "You hold the build; state how much of the current build is revision-three work."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "You hold the review cycle; state that each revision has reset the cycle."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "You are the engagement manager; state that the client has just sent a fourth revision."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D3-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Four work items in seven weeks"}, {"question": "Q-D3-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 asks what is delivered"}, {"question": "Q-D3-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Two stated requirements"}, {"question": "Q-D3-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 asks what is checked before acceptance"}, {"question": "Q-D3-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three means"}, {"question": "Q-D3-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-06a", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "blocking_dependency is an explicit none"}, {"question": "Q-D3-06b", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "blocking_dependency is an explicit none"}, {"question": "Q-D3-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B4 and B6 create the opportunity"}, {"question": "Q-D3-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D3-08", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "THE PRIMARY ELEMENT. A fourth move arrives in the round against three already absorbed"}, {"question": "Q-D3-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Test point at B6"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "WI1", "Item text": "the build", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "build, the review cycle"}, {"Item": "WI2", "Item text": "the review cycle", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "review cycle and the"}, {"Item": "WI3", "Item text": "the handover pack", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "handover pack — of"}, {"Item": "WI4", "Item text": "assess the fourth revision", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "fourth revision arrives in"}, {"Item": "SR1", "Item text": "a revision is accepted in writing before work begins on it", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "revision is accepted in writing before work begins"}, {"Item": "SR2", "Item text": "the handover pack is delivered at the contracted end date", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "revision is accepted in writing before work begins on it, and that the handover pack is delivered at the contracted end date"}], "source_sheet": {"d3_situation_class": "SC-D3-3", "workplace_demand": "Deciding what happens to work in progress when the brief is revised again.", "relevant_conduct": "The order stated; what was reduced, deferred or dropped; what was stated as held; which checks were named or performed; which means were named or used; what was identified as incomplete at handover; what was done with the work already performed when the requirement changed; the answer when the delivery state was put to the participant.", "irrelevant_conduct": "Who accepted the earlier three, WHICH IS A D2 MATTER; the co-participants'' positions.", "stated_standard": "SR-01 and SR-02.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"revision is accepted in writing before work begins\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations affecting turn order or response window are recorded and set timing_not_comparable.", "unsupported_inferences": "That accommodating the pattern was wrong; that the engagement manager should have stopped it; ANY INFERENCE THAT INTERNAL CLARITY SHOULD HAVE PRODUCED A DIFFERENT EXTERNAL ANSWER.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "work_items": [{"id": "WI1", "text": "the build"}, {"id": "WI2", "text": "the review cycle"}, {"id": "WI3", "text": "the handover pack"}, {"id": "WI4", "text": "assess the fourth revision"}], "deliverable_components": [{"id": "DC1", "text": "the build"}, {"id": "DC2", "text": "the review cycle"}, {"id": "DC3", "text": "the handover pack"}, {"id": "DC4", "text": "the revision assessment"}], "stated_requirements": [{"id": "SR1", "text": "a revision is accepted in writing before work begins on it"}, {"id": "SR2", "text": "the handover pack is delivered at the contracted end date"}], "available_checks": [{"id": "CK1", "text": "compare the fourth revision against the contracted scope"}, {"id": "CK2", "text": "confirm how much completed work each revision invalidates"}], "available_means": [{"id": "MN1", "text": "accept the fourth in writing with a revised date"}, {"id": "MN2", "text": "hold the fourth to a second phase"}, {"id": "MN3", "text": "deliver against revision three and log the fourth"}], "time_available": "Seven weeks.", "work_required": "Three pieces of about three weeks each plus an unassessed revision.", "blocking_dependency": null, "dependency_holder_role": null, "moved_standard_point": "B2, when the fourth revision is stated in the round.", "handover_point": "The contracted end date.", "delivery_state_record": "At B6: three pieces outstanding, three revisions absorbed, a fourth unassessed.", "delivery_test_point": "B6", "list_note": null, "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "The deadline or scope moves after work has begun", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D3-S4-010", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "6146fce4287c7a9360a838817bcebe08ca73b19bf2086656629ebb1928f9a145", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D3-S4-010' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_load_event(env_state, content_object_id, content_version_id, governed_status, notes) select 'design_only', o.content_object_id, v.content_version_id, 'DISABLED_PENDING_DECISION', 'T3A-D3-EXEC-001 v2.0 loaded not servable' from public.t3a_content_object o join public.t3a_d1_content_version v on v.content_object_id = o.content_object_id where o.dimension_id = 'D3' and o.identifier like 'T3A-D3-EXEC-001%' or (o.dimension_id = 'D3' and o.identifier like 'SRC-D3-%');
